<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <script>
  // Bell intro gate. Runs before first paint: shows at most once per 24h, never under
  // reduced motion. ?intro or #intro forces it (for review). site.js runs the rest.
  (function(){try{
    var K='ddf-intro-v1',D=864e5,n=Date.now(),last=parseInt(localStorage.getItem(K)||'0',10);
    var r=window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    var force=/[?&]intro\b/.test(location.search)||location.hash==='#intro';
    if(!r&&(force||n-last>D)){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-intro','active');if(!force)localStorage.setItem(K,String(n));
      // Only a visit that will ring the bell fetches the sound ahead of time.
      var l=document.createElement('link');l.rel='preload';l.as='fetch';l.crossOrigin='anonymous';l.href='{{ '/audio/bell.mp3' | url }}';document.head.appendChild(l);}
  }catch(e){}})();
  </script>
  <title>{% if title %}{{ title }} · {% endif %}The DingDong Foundation</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ description or 'Grants for church bells, electronic carillons, pipe organs, rose windows and the sacred arts.' }}">
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ '/favicon.svg' | url }}" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="preload" href="{{ '/fonts/great-vibes-latin.woff2' | url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/css/styles.css' | url }}?v={{ build.id }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/css/site.css' | url }}?v={{ build.id }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web@2.1.1/src/regular/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="intro" data-intro-overlay data-intro-audio="{{ '/audio/bell.mp3' | url }}" role="dialog" aria-label="Welcome to The DingDong Foundation">
    <div class="intro__glow"></div>
    <div class="intro__stage">
      <svg class="intro__bell" viewBox="0 0 120 114" width="150" height="143" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <!-- Minimal outline bell: one stroke weight, gold ink, no fill. Proportions follow the
             Holy Sepulchre bell in the Home hero photo: a rounded shoulder, a short nearly
             straight waist, and a wide flared lip about a third wider than the bell is tall. -->
        <g class="intro__bell-swing" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <!-- headstock pin and crown loop -->
          <circle cx="60" cy="4" r="2.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          <path d="M60 6.5 V 10"/>
          <path d="M54 16 a6 6 0 0 1 12 0"/>
          <!-- body -->
          <path d="M60 16 C 46 16, 36 21, 34 33 C 33 46, 33 56, 31 65 C 29 76, 22 84, 14 88 C 10 90.5, 12 94, 17 94 L 103 94 C 108 94, 110 90.5, 106 88 C 98 84, 91 76, 89 65 C 87 56, 87 46, 86 33 C 84 21, 74 16, 60 16 Z"/>
          <!-- clapper (lags behind the body, strikes the lip). Only the part that hangs below
               the lip is drawn; the shaft inside the bell is hidden by the wall. -->
          <g class="intro__bell-clapper">
            <path d="M60 94 V 97"/>
            <circle cx="60" cy="103" r="6"/>
          </g>
        </g>
      </svg>
      {#- No name on the overlay (client, 2026-09-29): the bell, the motto, the button. One motto
          line per place (client, 2026-09-23): the English line here, as on her business card;
          "Jubilate Deo" alone on the Home hero. Never both together. #}
      <div class="motto motto--light">
        <span class="motto__en">Make a Joyful Noise to the Lord</span>
      </div>
      <button class="btn intro__ring" type="button" data-intro-ring>Ring the bell</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- set navItems = [
    { url: "/", label: "Home" },
    { url: "/inspirations/", label: "Inspirations" },
    { url: "/guidelines/", label: "Guidelines" },
    { url: "/donate/", label: "Donate" },
    { url: "/resources/", label: "Resources" },
    { url: "/apply/", label: "Apply for a grant" }
  ] -%}
  {#- "Apply for a grant" is a plain nav link, last, and lives nowhere else on the site
      (client, 2026-09-06 and 2026-09-29: top navigation only). It is not a button. #}
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="site-header__inner">
      <a class="wordmark" href="{{ '/' | url }}" aria-label="The DingDong Foundation — home">
        <span class="wordmark__line">The DingDong</span>
        <span class="wordmark__line">Foundation</span>
      </a>
      {#- Phone-only disclosure. Six links at the 16pt floor cannot share a row with the
          wordmark, so below 900px they live behind this button. Hidden from desktop entirely. #}
      <button class="nav-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav" data-nav-toggle>
        <span class="nav-toggle__bars" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="nav-toggle__label">Menu</span>
      </button>
      <nav class="site-nav" id="site-nav" aria-label="Primary">
        {%- for item in navItems %}
        <a href="{{ item.url | url }}"{% if page.url == item.url %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ item.label }}<span aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>

  {#- Footer (client, 2026-09-29): the legal name and the town. No EIN, no street address,
      no email, no legal sentence, no Ave Maria. A PO Box line goes in when she has the number.
      The footer repeats nothing from the header (her text, 2026-09-06).
      The round bell photo from her business card sits beside the text (client, 2026-10-16): a
      black-and-white square crop of the Home hero photo, centred on the big bell, above the
      visitors. Decorative, so empty alt; the text beside it names the foundation. #}
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="site-footer__inner">
      <img class="site-footer__bell" src="{{ '/uploads/footer-bell.jpg' | url }}" alt="" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="site-footer__contact">
        <span>The DingDong Foundation, Inc.</span>
        <span>A 501(c)(3) private foundation</span>
        <span>Sarasota, Florida</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="{{ '/js/site.js' | url }}?v={{ build.id }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
